{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>And I, behold I, am bringing the flood</b>. I agree with those who said before me regarding \"what is man that You should remember him\" (Psalms 8:5) — this is the language of Rashi (Rashi on Genesis 6:17), from Bereshit Rabbah (Bereshit Rabbah 31:12). But I am astonished — how can he agree with them when He leaves them a remnant for great deliverance through Noah and his sons and every living thing, to multiply their seed like the sand? Perhaps it is agreement with their view in the sense that He will not spare them. And according to the truth, \"and I\" is like \"and I too will chastise you\" (Leviticus 26:28), and likewise \"As for Me, behold, My covenant is with you\" (Genesis 17:4), \"and as for Me, this is My covenant\" (Isaiah 59:21) — He says: My hand too shall be upon them, because they corrupted the earth. And therefore He said (Genesis 9:12), \"This is the sign of the covenant that I am giving\" — He strikes and His hands grow slack (Job 5:18), and the enlightened will understand:"], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:25:32.370216540Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}